LP-0002 — Anonymous M-of-N Multisig for the Logos Execution Zone
================================================================

This repository is a FORK of upstream Logos LEZ (logos-blockchain/logos-execution-zone)
at tag **v0.2.4**. The overwhelming majority of the code here is upstream work by the
Logos team — the state machine (`lee`), the privacy-preserving transaction circuit, the
public-transaction apply path, the `authenticated_transfer` and other builtin programs,
the sequencer, the indexer, and the wallet — and is used under upstream's licence terms
(see LICENSE / LICENSE-* in this tree). We claim no authorship over any of it.

Upstream project: https://github.com/logos-blockchain/logos-execution-zone
Version forked:   v0.2.4 (commit 47eba2564)

OUR LP-0002 CONTRIBUTION
------------------------
The LP-0002 solution adds an anonymous M-of-N multisig program: members enroll public
leaves into an on-chain registry, a proposal freezes the member set, and each approval
is a privacy-preserving (ZK) transaction proving in-guest Merkle membership and
recording a proposal-bound nullifier. Files we authored or modified, in full:

  Program + guest
      lez/programs/msig/core/Cargo.toml
      lez/programs/msig/core/src/lib.rs          (msig_core: types, Merkle scheme, domains)
      lee/state_machine/test_methods/guest/src/bin/msig.rs   (the on-chain guest)
      lee/state_machine/test_methods/guest/Cargo.toml

